# Boost on 12's end save (AUTHORING.md, Boosts): party strength only, the story stays played.
# Castelia has no Pokemon Center on the way (its door is on the waterfront's rails): the hideout grunt (trdata #552:
# Sandile 17 x2), the gym's Harlequins and Burgh (trdata #22: Whirlipede 21, Dwebble 21, Leavanny 23; scr 0058
# @0x0249) wore the chain's party down and Burgh whited it out on Black. A Fire carrier against the bugs, led by
# lead.press, strong enough to carry on to Elesa (16: Emolga 25 x2, Zebstrika 27 whited out a Darumaka 33 on White;
# the party is full after this, so no later boost can add one): Darmanitan (555) at 36 with Fire Punch (7), Hammer
# Arm (359), Rock Tomb (317, for Dwebble and Emolga) and Headbutt (29).
party 555 36
party-move 5 0 7
party-move 5 1 359
party-move 5 2 317
party-move 5 3 29
